    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00008 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00008-s " data-id="e00008" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00008">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00009-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00009">The whole weekend, not a slot</p>
					<h1 data-interaction-id="e0000a" class="e-ykrhga-e0000a-s e-heading-base">You get it from Friday lunchtime until Sunday breakfast.</h1>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000b">A 17th century threshing barn, twelve acres, and a farmhouse that sleeps 22, hired dry for the whole weekend. You bring the caterer, the drink and the music. We bring the building and get out of the way.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000c-s " data-id="e0000c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000c">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000d"><a href="#book-a-viewing" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Book a viewing
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000e">Tuesday and Thursday mornings, and one Saturday a month.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000f-s " data-id="e0000f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000f">
    			<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0000g-s" data-interaction-id="e0000g" id="145" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-long-barn-weddings-barn_interior.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-long-barn-weddings-barn_interior.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-long-barn-weddings-barn_interior-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-long-barn-weddings-barn_interior-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="Halcyon Barn dressed for a wedding: long trestle tables running the length of a 17th century oak truss roof strung with festoon lights"/>					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000h">34m of oak truss, 140 down the middle</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000i-s " data-id="e0000i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000i">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000j-s " data-id="e0000j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000k e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0000k-s " data-id="e0000k" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0000k">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000l-s " data-id="e0000l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000m">Section one · the weekend</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0000n" class="e-ykrhga-e0000n-s e-heading-base">Forty-five hours, in order.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000o">Friday 2pm to Sunday 11am. This is the whole thing, hour by hour, with nothing quietly left off it.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000p-s " data-id="e0000p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000p">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000q-s " data-id="e0000q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000q">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000r-s " data-id="e0000r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000r">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000s-s " data-id="e0000s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000s">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000t-s " data-id="e0000t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000t">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000u-s " data-id="e0000u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000u">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000v">Friday · 2pm</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000w" class="e-ykrhga-e0000w-s e-heading-base">The keys, and an empty barn</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000x">Friday 2pm: the keys, the barn empty and swept, and eight hours to make it yours. Nobody stands over you with a schedule. The caretaker shows you the fuse board, the water, and the switch nobody can ever find, then leaves you to it.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000y-s " data-id="e0000y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000z-s " data-id="e0000z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000z">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00010 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00010-s " data-id="e00010" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00010">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00011 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00011-s " data-id="e00011" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00011">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00012 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00012-s " data-id="e00012" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00012">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00013-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00013">Friday · 9pm</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00014" class="e-ykrhga-e00014-s e-heading-base">Pizza on the floor</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00015-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00015">Most couples eat pizza on the floor at nine and it is usually the best bit of the weekend. Half the table has driven three hours. Nobody is dressed. Somebody has already put the lights up twice.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00016 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00016-s " data-id="e00016" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00016">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00017 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00017-s " data-id="e00017" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00017">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00018 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00018-s " data-id="e00018" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00018">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00019 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00019-s " data-id="e00019" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00019">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001a-s " data-id="e0001a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001b">Saturday · 1pm</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001c" class="e-ykrhga-e0001c-s e-heading-base">Ceremony, inside or in the meadow</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001d">Saturday: ceremony inside or in the meadow, drinks in the yard, long tables the length of the barn, and a licence until 1am with amplified music until midnight.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001e-s " data-id="e0001e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001f-s " data-id="e0001f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001g-s " data-id="e0001g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001g">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001h-s " data-id="e0001h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001h">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001i-s " data-id="e0001i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001i">
    			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0001j-s" data-interaction-id="e0001j" id="147" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-long-barn-weddings-meadow_ceremony.jpg" width="1024" height="768" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-long-barn-weddings-meadow_ceremony.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-long-barn-weddings-meadow_ceremony-300x225.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-long-barn-weddings-meadow_ceremony-768x576.jpg 768w" alt="An outdoor wedding ceremony in the meadow at Halcyon Barn"/>					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001k">The meadow — ceremony at one, if the sky allows</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001l-s " data-id="e0001l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001m-s " data-id="e0001m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001m">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001n-s " data-id="e0001n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001n">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001o-s " data-id="e0001o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001o">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001p-s " data-id="e0001p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001p">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001q">Saturday · 3pm</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001r" class="e-ykrhga-e0001r-s e-heading-base">Drinks in the yard</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001s">Cobbles, a low wall everyone ends up sitting on, and twelve acres for people to wander into. If the weather turns, the barn doors are eight feet wide and the whole thing moves inside in about four minutes.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001t-s " data-id="e0001t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001t">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001u-s " data-id="e0001u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001u">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001v-s " data-id="e0001v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001v">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001w-s " data-id="e0001w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001w">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001x-s " data-id="e0001x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001x">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001y">Saturday · 6pm</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001z" class="e-ykrhga-e0001z-s e-heading-base">Long tables, the length of the barn</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00020-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00020">Fourteen trestles end to end under the trusses. Your caterer serves from the yard end and the band builds at the other, so nothing has to be shifted between courses.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00021 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00021-s " data-id="e00021" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00021">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00022 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00022-s " data-id="e00022" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00022">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00023 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00023-s " data-id="e00023" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00023">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00024 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00024-s " data-id="e00024" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00024">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00025 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00025-s " data-id="e00025" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00025">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00026-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00026">Saturday · midnight</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00027" class="e-ykrhga-e00027-s e-heading-base">Amplified music off, licence until one</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00028-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00028">The band stops at twelve and the bar runs to one. The last hour is nearly always the quiet one — in the yard, doors open, somebody making tea for eleven people.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00029 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00029-s " data-id="e00029" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00029">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002a-s " data-id="e0002a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002a">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002b-s " data-id="e0002b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002b">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002c-s " data-id="e0002c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002c">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002d-s " data-id="e0002d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002d">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002e">Sunday · 9am</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002f" class="e-ykrhga-e0002f-s e-heading-base">Breakfast in the farmhouse</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002g">Sunday: breakfast in the farmhouse, a slow clear-up, out by eleven. We do not chase you at nine with a clipboard.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002h-s " data-id="e0002h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002h">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002i-s " data-id="e0002i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002i">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002j-s " data-id="e0002j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002j">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002k-s " data-id="e0002k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002k">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002l-s " data-id="e0002l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002l">
    			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0002m-s" data-interaction-id="e0002m" id="146" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-long-barn-weddings-farmhouse_morning.jpg" width="768" height="1024" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-long-barn-weddings-farmhouse_morning.jpg 768w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-long-barn-weddings-farmhouse_morning-225x300.jpg 225w" alt="The farmhouse at Halcyon Barn on a Sunday morning, where twenty-two guests sleep and breakfast is served"/>					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002n">The farmhouse — nine bedrooms, twenty-two beds</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002o-s " data-id="e0002o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002o">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002p-s " data-id="e0002p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002p">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002q-s " data-id="e0002q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002q">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002r-s " data-id="e0002r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002r">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002s-s " data-id="e0002s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002s">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002t">Sunday · 11am</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002u" class="e-ykrhga-e0002u-s e-heading-base">Out by eleven</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002v">Bins are ours, bottles are yours, and the field will still be there. Most people leave later than they planned and we have never once minded.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002w-s " data-id="e0002w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002w">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002x-s " data-id="e0002x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002y e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0002y-s " data-id="e0002y" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0002y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002z-s " data-id="e0002z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002z">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00030-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00030">Section two · the building</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00031" class="e-ykrhga-e00031-s e-heading-base">Thirty-four metres of barn, and what it does in the rain.</h2>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00032 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00032-s " data-id="e00032" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00032">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00033-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00033">Barn is 34m by 11m. 140 seated at long tables, 96 with a dance floor and a band, 180 standing. Fully covered, heated, and it has never once been rained off.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00034 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00034-s " data-id="e00034" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00034">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00035 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00035-s " data-id="e00035" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00035">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00036-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00036">34 × 11</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00037-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00037">metres, wall to wall</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00038 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00038-s " data-id="e00038" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00038">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00039-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00039">140</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003a">seated at long tables</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003b-s " data-id="e0003b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003b">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003c">96</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003d">with a floor and a band</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003e-s " data-id="e0003e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003e">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003f">180</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003g">standing, doors open</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003h e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0003h-s " data-id="e0003h" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0003h">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003i-s " data-id="e0003i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003i">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0003j" class="e-ykrhga-e0003j-s e-heading-base">In the rain</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003k">Nothing dramatic happens. Two sets of doors close, the heaters go on, the ceremony moves under the trusses, and the light gets better. In eleven years we have moved fourteen ceremonies indoors at short notice, and not one couple has said afterwards that it spoiled the day.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003l-s " data-id="e0003l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003l">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0003m" class="e-ykrhga-e0003m-s e-heading-base">The unglamorous facts</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003n">The floor is flagstone and oak, level throughout, and it takes a heel. Heating is underfloor at the yard end and three radiant panels at the other. There is a step at the west door and a ramp beside it. The nearest neighbour is 400 metres away, which is why the licence runs to one.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003o-s " data-id="e0003o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003o">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003p-s " data-id="e0003p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003p">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003q-s " data-id="e0003q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003q">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003r">Section three · the honest list</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0003s" class="e-ykrhga-e0003s-s e-heading-base">What is included, and what genuinely is not.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003t">Included: the barn, the yard, twelve acres, 140 chairs, 14 trestle tables, the farmhouse, parking, and a caretaker on site all weekend. Not included: catering, bar, glassware, linen, and anything with a flame.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003u e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0003u-s " data-id="e0003u" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0003u">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003v-s " data-id="e0003v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003v">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003w">In the price</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003x-s " data-id="e0003x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003y-s " data-id="e0003y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003y">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003z">The barn, swept and empty</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00040 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00040-s " data-id="e00040" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00040">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00041 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00041-s " data-id="e00041" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00041">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00042-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00042">The yard and the twelve acres</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00043 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00043-s " data-id="e00043" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00043">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00044 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00044-s " data-id="e00044" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00044">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00045-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00045">140 chairs</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00046 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00046-s " data-id="e00046" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00046">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00047 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00047-s " data-id="e00047" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00047">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00048-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00048">14 trestle tables</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00049 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00049-s " data-id="e00049" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00049">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004a-s " data-id="e0004a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004a">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004b">The farmhouse, sleeping 22</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004c-s " data-id="e0004c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004c">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004d-s " data-id="e0004d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004d">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004e">Parking for 70 cars</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004f-s " data-id="e0004f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004g-s " data-id="e0004g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004g">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004h">A caretaker on site all weekend</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004i-s " data-id="e0004i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004i">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004j-s " data-id="e0004j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004j">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004k">Heat, power, water and the prep kitchen</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004l-s " data-id="e0004l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004m">Not in the price</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004n-s " data-id="e0004n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004o-s " data-id="e0004o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004o">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004p">Catering — you bring your own</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004q-s " data-id="e0004q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004q">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004r-s " data-id="e0004r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004r">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004s">A bar, and anybody to run it</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004t-s " data-id="e0004t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004t">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004u-s " data-id="e0004u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004u">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004v">Glassware, crockery and cutlery</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004w-s " data-id="e0004w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004w">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004x-s " data-id="e0004x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004x">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004y">Linen and napkins</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004z-s " data-id="e0004z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004z">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00050 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00050-s " data-id="e00050" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00050">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00051-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00051">Anything with an unenclosed flame</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00052 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00052-s " data-id="e00052" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00052">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00053 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00053-s " data-id="e00053" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00053">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00054-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00054">A marquee — you will not need one</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00055-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00055">Dry hire means dry hire. We would rather tell you in a cold February viewing than surprise you in June.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00056 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00056-s " data-id="e00056" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00056">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00057 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00057-s " data-id="e00057" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00057">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00058 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00058-s " data-id="e00058" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00058">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00059 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00059-s " data-id="e00059" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00059">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005a">Section four · food</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0005b" class="e-ykrhga-e0005b-s e-heading-base">Six caterers we love. Or bring your own.</h2>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005c-s " data-id="e0005c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005c">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005d">Six caterers we love and trust, or bring your own for a £400 kitchen fee. We do not take commission from any of them and we will say so on the viewing.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005e e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0005e-s " data-id="e0005e" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005f-s " data-id="e0005f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005f">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005g">Hollow &amp; Vine</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005h">Long-table feasting, most of it off one fire in the yard.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005i-s " data-id="e0005i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005i">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005j">The Wheelwright's Kitchen</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005k">Proper British, three courses, plated, no foam.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005l-s " data-id="e0005l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005m">Saltbox</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005n">Mediterranean sharing plates and genuinely very good bread.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005o-s " data-id="e0005o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005o">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005p">Ferment</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005q">Entirely vegetarian, and the only one that has converted a father-in-law.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005r-s " data-id="e0005r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005r">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005s">Ridgeway Wood-Fired</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005t">Pizza on the Friday, hog on the Saturday, one van for both.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005u-s " data-id="e0005u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005u">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005v">Marsh &amp; Daughter</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005w">Canapés and a wedding breakfast that actually runs to time.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005x-s " data-id="e0005x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005x">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005y" class="e-ykrhga-e0005y-s e-heading-base">Bringing your own</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005z">The £400 covers the prep kitchen, the water, the power, the waste, and a caretaker who will find them a step ladder at seven on a Saturday morning. We ask for public liability cover and a hygiene rating of four or five. That is the entire list of conditions.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00060 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00060-s " data-id="e00060" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00060">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00061 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00061-s " data-id="e00061" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00061">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00062 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00062-s " data-id="e00062" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00062">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00063 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00063-s " data-id="e00063" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00063">
    			<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e00064-s" data-interaction-id="e00064" id="146" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-long-barn-weddings-farmhouse_morning.jpg" width="768" height="1024" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-long-barn-weddings-farmhouse_morning.jpg 768w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-long-barn-weddings-farmhouse_morning-225x300.jpg 225w" alt="The farmhouse at Halcyon Barn on a Sunday morning, where twenty-two guests sleep and breakfast is served"/>		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00065 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00065-s " data-id="e00065" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00065">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00066-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00066">Section five · beds</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00067" class="e-ykrhga-e00067-s e-heading-base">Twenty-two sleep here. Everybody else is fifteen minutes away.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00068-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00068">Nine bedrooms across the farmhouse and the granary: one with a bath you can lie down in, four doubles, three twins, and a bunk room the children fight over. Twenty-two actual beds — no camp beds, no sofa arrangements, nobody counting the sofa.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00069 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00069-s " data-id="e00069" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00069">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006a-s " data-id="e0006a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006a">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006b-s " data-id="e0006b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006b">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006c">The Fleece in the village holds eight rooms for us until six weeks out.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006d-s " data-id="e0006d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006d">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006e-s " data-id="e0006e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006e">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006f">Two bed and breakfasts within a mile, both of which will do an early breakfast.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006g-s " data-id="e0006g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006g">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006h-s " data-id="e0006h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006h">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006i">A chain hotel twenty minutes out, for the guests who specifically want one.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006j-s " data-id="e0006j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006k-s " data-id="e0006k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006k">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006l">Taxis: book them in March, not in June. There are four firms and they all fill.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006m-s " data-id="e0006m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006m">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006n-s " data-id="e0006n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006o e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0006o-s " data-id="e0006o" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0006o">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006p-s " data-id="e0006p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006p">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006q">Section six · price</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0006r" class="e-ykrhga-e0006r-s e-heading-base">Price by season, and what a Friday saves you.</h2>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006s-s " data-id="e0006s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006s">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006t">March to May 6,400. June to September 9,800. October to February 4,900. Friday weddings are 1,200 less and nobody has ever regretted one.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006u-s " data-id="e0006u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006u">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006v-s " data-id="e0006v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006v">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006w">March to May</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006x">6,400</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006y">Cold mornings, long light by seven, and the meadow at its best in the second week of May.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006z-s " data-id="e0006z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006z">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00070-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00070">June to September</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00071-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00071">9,800</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00072-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00072">The busy half. Saturdays in June and September go eighteen months out; August rarely does.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00073 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00073-s " data-id="e00073" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00073">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00074-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00074">October to February</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00075-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00075">4,900</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00076-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00076">Candles at four in the afternoon and a barn warmer than most houses. Our own favourite.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00077 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00077-s " data-id="e00077" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00077">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00078 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00078-s " data-id="e00078" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00078">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00079" class="e-ykrhga-e00079-s e-heading-base">A Friday is 1,200 less</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007a">Same barn, same forty-five hours, same Sunday breakfast — it simply starts on the Thursday afternoon instead. The guests travelling any distance were taking the Friday off anyway. Nobody has ever regretted one.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007b-s " data-id="e0007b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007b">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007c">Every price is the whole weekend, Friday 2pm to Sunday 11am, VAT included. No per-head charge, no corkage, and no commission on anything you book yourselves.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007d"><strong>We hold a date for seven days, free, while you think about it.</strong></p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007e-s " data-id="e0007e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007f-s " data-id="e0007f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007g e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0007g-s " data-id="e0007g" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0007g">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007h-s " data-id="e0007h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007h">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007i">Section seven · six weekends</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0007j" class="e-ykrhga-e0007j-s e-heading-base">Six couples. Six very different weddings.</h2>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007k-s " data-id="e0007k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007k">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007l">Same building, same forty-five hours. This is what people have actually done with it.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007m e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0007m-s " data-id="e0007m" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0007m">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007n-s " data-id="e0007n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007n">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007o">112 guests · June</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0007p" class="e-ykrhga-e0007p-s e-heading-base">Nadia &amp; Tom</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007q">A ceilidh, a curry, and a barn wedding they had been told would need a marquee. It did not.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007r-s " data-id="e0007r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007r">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007s">138 guests · September</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0007t" class="e-ykrhga-e0007t-s e-heading-base">Ellie &amp; Priya</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007u">The full length of the barn at long tables. Two caterers, two families, one lunch that ran until five.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007v-s " data-id="e0007v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007v">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007w">94 guests · February</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0007x" class="e-ykrhga-e0007x-s e-heading-base">Sam &amp; Jo</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007y">Candles down the trusses from four in the afternoon, hot toddies in the yard, everyone home by ten.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007z-s " data-id="e0007z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007z">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00080-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00080">126 guests · May</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00081" class="e-ykrhga-e00081-s e-heading-base">Rosie &amp; Will</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00082-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00082">A meadow ceremony that moved indoors at eleven in the morning. It rained for forty minutes and the photographs are better for it.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00083 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00083-s " data-id="e00083" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00083">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00084-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00084">90 guests · August</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00085" class="e-ykrhga-e00085-s e-heading-base">Aisha &amp; Dan</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00086-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00086">A Friday wedding. They saved 1,200, kept the barn until Sunday, and spent Saturday in the field with the leftovers.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00087 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00087-s " data-id="e00087" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00087">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00088-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00088">134 guests · October</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00089" class="e-ykrhga-e00089-s e-heading-base">Marta &amp; Ines</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008a">Three courses, a brass band, and a first dance at eleven that everybody had given up waiting for.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008b-s " data-id="e0008b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008b" id="book-a-viewing">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008c-s " data-id="e0008c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008c">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008d-s " data-id="e0008d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008d">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008e-s " data-id="e0008e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008f-s " data-id="e0008f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008f">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008g-s " data-id="e0008g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008g">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008h e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0008h-s " data-id="e0008h" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0008h">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008i-s " data-id="e0008i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008i">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008j">Section eight · come and see it</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0008k" class="e-ykrhga-e0008k-s e-heading-base">Book a viewing.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008l">Viewings take an hour. We walk the weekend in the order it happens — the barn empty on the Friday, the meadow, the yard, the long tables, the farmhouse, the Sunday kitchen — and we will tell you on the day whether your date is free. Bring the person who asks the awkward questions.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008m-s " data-id="e0008m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008m">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008n"><a href="mailto:viewings@thelongbarn.example" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Book a viewing
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008o"><a href="tel:+441632960163" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		01632 960163
	</a></p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008p-s " data-id="e0008p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008p">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008q-s " data-id="e0008q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008q">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008r-s " data-id="e0008r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008r">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008s">Tuesday and Thursday, 10am and 11.30am.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008t-s " data-id="e0008t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008t">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008u-s " data-id="e0008u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008u">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008v">One Saturday a month, when the barn is empty.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008w-s " data-id="e0008w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008w">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008x-s " data-id="e0008x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008x">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008y">viewings@thelongbarn.example — answered within a day.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008z-s " data-id="e0008z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008z">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00090 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00090-s " data-id="e00090" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00090">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00091-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00091">Halcyon Barn, Harrowfield Drove, Wiltshire SN88 1AA.</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00092-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00092">We take one wedding a weekend and about thirty a year. If your date has gone we will say so in the first email rather than the third.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>

</div>
